{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The style layer’s predicate."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"NSPredicate","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSPredicate","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"predicate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the style layer’s predicate to include only the features in the source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layer that satisfy a condition that you define. If the style layer initially","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"comes from the style, its predicate corresponds to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"filter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property in the style JSON.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See the “","type":"text"},{"text":"Predicates and Expressions","type":"text"},{"text":"”","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"guide for details about the predicate syntax supported by this class.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To filter the layer to include only the features whose ","type":"text"},{"code":"index","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute is 5","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or 10 and whose ","type":"text"},{"code":"ele","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute is at least 1,500, you could create an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSCompoundPredicate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" along these lines:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let layer = MLNLine